# The wait is in the procedure, and too short

Round 1 of #1905 (CHECK2-A). Shrinking `30초` to `3초` left the surrounding
keywords intact, so a keyword check stayed green while the gap stopped covering
what it exists to cover — the `review-gate` queue, measured at 35s and 84s on
two of the last 25 runs.

Paired with `wait-outside-procedure` on purpose: that one dies if the guard
stops scoping the wait to the procedure, this one dies if the guard stops
reading the number. Either half alone leaves the other mutation green.
